#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:605
msgid ""
"The <interface>File Open</interface> dialog can be launched using three "
"alternative approaches. <_:variablelist-1/> All three methods will result in"
" the equivalent action, launching the <interface>File Open</interface> "
"dialog to allow the user to find the file that they wish to open."
msgstr ""
"Dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> kan öppnas på tre olika sätt. "
"<_:variablelist-1/> Alla tre metoderna leder till samma resultat: "
"dialogrutan <interface>Öppna fil</interface> öppnas så att du kan leta upp "
"filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:677
msgid "Navigate the file system to open the folder with the file."
msgstr "Navigera i filsystemet till mappen som innehåller filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:681
msgid ""
"Changing folders involves selecting a starting folder in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> which contains the folder with the desired file, "
"and then double-clicking on the folders listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> until the folder containing the file has been "
"reached. The folder hierarchy listed in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>can also be used to navigate up the hierarchy if a"
" folder was opened by mistake. As explained below, a user can move around "
"the hierarchy with as many folder selections as they need to reach the "
"folder containing the file the user desires to open."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill byta mapp väljer du en startmapp i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> som innehåller mappen du söker. Dubbelklicka "
"sedan på mapparna i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> tills du "
"kommer till mappen med filen. Du kan också använda mappträdet i område "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> för att gå uppåt om du råkat öppna fel "
"mapp. Du kan byta mappar så många gånger som behövs för att hitta filen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:696
msgid ""
"To select a new folder, one of the starting folders which contains the "
"desired folder must first be selected and then the hierarchy must be "
"navigated to find the desired folder, and this folder must be opened to "
"expose its contents. As explained below, a user can move around the "
"hierarchy using as many changes as they need to choose the folder in which "
"to save their <application>Gnumeric</application> file."
msgstr ""
"Om du vill välja en ny mapp börjar du med att välja en startmapp som "
"innehåller den. Navigera sedan i mappträdet tills du hittar mappen och öppna"
" den så att innehållet visas. Du kan gå mellan mappar så många gånger som "
"behövs för att välja mappen där du vill spara filen i "
"<application>Gnumeric</application>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:708
msgid "Select a starting folder in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."
msgstr "Välj en startmapp i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:712
msgid ""
"The first step in choosing a new folder requires selecting, in area "
"<emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis>, a starting folder which contains the "
"desired folder. The new starting folder is chosen by placing the mouse "
"pointer over the folder name and double clicking (click twice rapidly "
"without moving the mouse) with the primary mouse button. This will change "
"the leftmost button in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> and change "
"the folders and files listed in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> to"
" list the contents of the starting folder which was just selected."
msgstr ""
"Välj först en startmapp i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">A</emphasis> som "
"innehåller mappen du söker. Håll pekaren över namnet på mappen och "
"dubbelklicka med primär musknapp, det vill säga klicka snabbt två gånger "
"utan att flytta pekaren. Då ändras den vänstra knappen i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> och listan i område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> visar innehållet i den valda startmappen."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:728
msgid ""
"Navigate the filesystem to reach the desired folder using area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."
msgstr ""
"Navigera i filsystemet till mappen du söker med område <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>."

#. from gnome:reviewed/gnumeric/master/help
#: C/gnumeric.xml:732
msgid ""
"The next step involves descending the folder tree to reach the desired "
"folder. This requires double clicking the sub-folder of the staring folder "
"which contains the desired folder and continuing through the whole hierarchy"
" until the desired folder is reached. After each double click, the selected "
"folder is added as the right most button in area <emphasis "
"role=\"bold\">B</emphasis> and the contents of the selected folder are shown"
" in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>. Once the desired folder is "
"reached, it must be opened in the same way, so that its contents are listed "
"in area <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> and the file can then be saved "
"into this folder by clicking on the <guibutton>Save</guibutton> button."
msgstr ""
"Fortsätt sedan nedåt i mappträdet tills du kommer till mappen du söker. "
"Dubbelklicka på den undermapp i startmappen som innehåller nästa mapp, och "
"fortsätt genom hela trädet. Efter varje dubbelklick läggs den valda mappen "
"till som den högra knappen i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">B</emphasis>, "
"och innehållet visas i område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis>. När du "
"kommer till rätt mapp öppnar du den på samma sätt. Då visas innehållet i "
"område <emphasis role=\"bold\">C</emphasis> och du kan spara filen där genom"
" att klicka på knappen <guibutton>Spara</guibutton>."
